---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import gate from '../../data/build-paid-start-gate.json';

const items = gate.required_external_evidence;
---

<Layout title="BUILD Paid Start Gate | BitEvo" description="Public-safe gate showing what external evidence must exist before the existing BUILD diagnostic can move from an accepted proposal to delivery. No payment processing, invoice, checkout, signature, booking or testing authorization.">
  <section class="section"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">BUILD · PAID START GATE · PUBLIC TEMPLATE ONLY</div><h1 class="display">A proposal is not a paid start.</h1><p class="lede">Before delivery can begin, the accepted proposal/scope, payment evidence, written Rules of Engagement, frozen buyer baseline, named owner/reviewer, safe inputs and explicit start authorization must all be confirmed outside this public page.</p></div></section>

  <section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container panel" role="note"><strong>NO PAYMENT PROCESSING · NO INVOICE · NO CHECKOUT · NO SIGNATURE · NO BOOKING · NO DELIVERY START · NO TESTING AUTHORIZATION</strong><p>This page represents no customer state and cannot prove payment. It creates no contract, payment request, delivery event or testing permission.</p></div></section>

  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">External-evidence gate</div><h2 class="section-title">Seven conditions must be evidenced before delivery can be called started.</h2>{items.map((item,index) => <article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')} · {item.status}</div><h3>{item.label}</h3></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container"><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Payment evidence boundary</div><h2>This page cannot prove payment.</h2><p>No receiving rail is published here. Payment evidence must come from the separately agreed direct business channel; the public site does not issue or verify it.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Delivery boundary</div><h2>Delivery remains unstarted by default.</h2><p>The public template does not represent an accepted proposal, received payment, agreed RoE, delivery start, measured value or renewal/expansion evidence. Those stages require separate real-world evidence.</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="section section-rule"><div class="container hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/build/proposal-readiness">Back to proposal readiness</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/audit-intake">Prepare the scope brief</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/build/paid-start-gate.json">Open machine-readable gate</a></div></section>
</Layout>
